WEBVTT

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:01.410
UNK

00:00:03.572 --> 00:00:08.130
ot do, az ikh bin shoyn durkhgegangen itster

00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:11.919
dem tsveyendike durkhkukung,

00:00:12.735 --> 00:00:15.547
un hobn mir durkhgekukt groyse profesorn,

00:00:16.245 --> 00:00:21.560
mit zayne, der profesor mit zayne shilers,

00:00:23.248 --> 00:00:26.270
dos iz, hob ikh farshtanen

00:00:26.758 --> 00:00:29.587
az es iz nito keyn shum lere bay zey.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:34.886
bay zey in di hoykh-shuln hot men gelernt vi tsu khapn a yidn.

00:00:37.086 --> 00:00:40.939
heyst dos az zey hobn dos nit gefunen di,

00:00:40.939 --> 00:00:43.526
dem untersheyd fun a yidn

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:45.534
biz an ander folk.

00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:49.130
zey kenen mernit gefinen,

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:54.670
 di folk, PREDPOLOZHIM, oyb, a bisl a harbe, a, a, krumer noz,

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:57.751
iz bay zey, bay di ARMYANer, mer krumere nezer!

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.549
oyb bay mir iz shvartse oygn,

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:04.958
oder a gele shvartskeyt,

00:01:05.638 --> 00:01:07.809
iz ot iz bay dir di oygn

00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:09.936
gor shvartsinke.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.889
bay mir iz andere, nit yene.

00:01:13.789 --> 00:01:16.500
bay im iz andere. bay undz iz gor di ⟨n-⟩...

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.516
zeyer lere iz, dos iz a gelekhter-mayse.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:26.410
dos iz poshet zey hobn geharget yidn bikhlal vayle mir zaynen geven arayngeshribn

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:29.730
in der finfter GRAFA mir zaynen geven ongeshribn yidn.

00:01:30.394 --> 00:01:32.480
di vos hobn gevust, di,

00:01:32.706 --> 00:01:35.600
 di antisemitn

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:38.420
flegn unterzogn ver s'iz a yid,

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:42.842
un bikhlal, az me falt arayn in a yidisher shtetl oder in a yidisher shtot,

00:01:44.097 --> 00:01:47.181
tsvishn ale rusn, ⟨V-⟩ zet men ⟨az⟩ antkegn a rus,

00:01:47.181 --> 00:01:49.367
kegn an ARIETS iz a yid

00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:52.790
hot a bisinke a untersheyd. ot azoy o.

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:56.310
nor azoy iz der yid a sheyne folk.

00:01:56.685 --> 00:01:58.771
der yid iz a shtoltse folk.

00:01:59.942 --> 00:02:04.340
der yid... keyn mol nit gekrokhn kemfn oyf yenem.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.855
a yid vet nit geyn hargenen a kind.

00:02:07.418 --> 00:02:10.530
nit geyn! KROME a meshugener. s'ken trefn a meshugener,

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.381
nor a gantse folk zol zayn meshugoim, zol zayn banditn

00:02:14.421 --> 00:02:16.172
iz nito tsvishn yidn.

00:02:16.172 --> 00:02:17.960
dos iz mayn shtoltskeyt.

00:02:17.678 --> 00:02:20.290
un vos hot geshen NEXT? vos...?

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:25.310
ot do iz, nokh deroyf... ikh vel shoyn durkhlozn. mir hobn gearbet, gehorevet...

00:02:25.828 --> 00:02:29.450
 hot men OT- ongehoybn traybn in alerleyike lagern.

00:02:29.507 --> 00:02:31.370
in an andere lager?

00:02:30.165 --> 00:02:31.745
in andere lagern.

00:02:32.106 --> 00:02:38.327
⟨d-⟩ genoy veys ikh shoyn nit, glaykh, ⟨f- v-⟩ vu frier, vu shpeter,

00:02:38.586 --> 00:02:43.237
nor ikh vel dir entfern glaykh in velkhe lagern ikh bin geven

00:02:43.395 --> 00:02:46.650
un vos far a arbetn hot men mir gegebn...

00:02:46.083 --> 00:02:47.310
in Doytshland?

00:02:46.986 --> 00:02:51.017
ye, in Doytshland... s'zol zayn gikher mit der zakh.

00:02:51.023 --> 00:02:56.060
farshteyst? vorem yeder minut, yeder sho, y- yeder z- ikh reyd,

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.850
az ikh bin yeder vayle geven in sakones, ⟨in s-⟩ in,

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:02.627
iberike s- eyn yid, v⟨os ho⟩t nit g- vos hot nit getort lebn

00:03:03.426 --> 00:03:08.114
in a ⟨f-⟩ un ikh bin do in a farmakhtn, PONIMAESH', ertl tsvishn zey, tsvishn ale,

00:03:08.114 --> 00:03:11.520
 farreter, un tsvishn di sonim, banditn.

00:03:14.513 --> 00:03:17.241
m'hot mir etlekhe mol arayngerufn in komendatur.

00:03:17.348 --> 00:03:19.603
kh'hob gemeynt az me f- ruft mir hargenen.

00:03:20.605 --> 00:03:23.316
herst, eyn mol hot men mir aroysgerufn in komendatur.

00:03:23.946 --> 00:03:28.344
fregt zikh bay mir eyner, a tsiviler... ikh ze az s'iz a UKRAINETS,

00:03:29.177 --> 00:03:32.080
a politsyant... zogt er,

00:03:32.147 --> 00:03:35.330
"du bist geven in fir hundert I elftn pekhotnem polk?"

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:38.519
zog ikh, "ye."

00:03:38.543 --> 00:03:42.502
ikh bin geven in tsvey hundert draysik zekstn artileristn, artiler⟨i⟩,

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:49.120
 pushkes, un pekhotnem, dos iz, pekhotne, dos iz infanterye, PO-MOEMU.

00:03:49.242 --> 00:03:56.678
iz bin ikh geven in aza po-, ikh hob gezogt az ikh bin in aza polk geven, un ikh bin nit keyn, elterer leytenant. kh'hob gezogt az ikh bin

00:03:57.088 --> 00:03:58.938
a klenerer leytenant.

00:04:00.227 --> 00:04:04.970
iz hot er mir aroysgerufn. zogt er,

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:12.680
"TY ZNAESH'," zogt er, "TAKOGO I TAKOGO?" hot er mir ongerufn a nomen. bay mir iz farshribn der nomen. YA KOGDA-TO,

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:15.864
ikh hob frier im geven ergets farshribn.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:20.850
⟨YA ZNA-⟩... zog ikh, "ver iz er?" a yidishn nomen hot er mir ongerufn.

00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.542
"er iz," zogt er, "a KAPEL'MASTER."

00:04:24.156 --> 00:04:28.414
a KAPEL'MASTER iz der vos firt on mit di muzik. yeder polk

00:04:28.414 --> 00:04:29.904
hot an orkester

00:04:30.248 --> 00:04:32.990
mit troybn, mit a baraban.

00:04:33.184 --> 00:04:36.519
veyst? un a KAPEL'MASTER vos makht ot azoy mit di hent.

00:04:37.487 --> 00:04:40.760
zog ikh, "CHTO TY MNE GOVORISH'?"

00:04:41.098 --> 00:04:42.729
"vos zogstu mir?

00:04:43.022 --> 00:04:46.509
ikh bin," zog ikh, "nit lang," zog ikh, "do in polk.

00:04:47.072 --> 00:04:50.720
ikh bin," zog ikh, "tsvey vokhn in polk.

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:55.790
ikh bin," zog ikh, "glaykh," zog ikh, "in OKOP hot men mir arayngetribn.

00:04:56.269 --> 00:04:59.267
ikh hob afile keyn eyn mol nit oysgeshosn mitn biks.

00:05:00.015 --> 00:05:01.990
ikh hob nit gezen keyn KAPEL'MASTER.

00:05:02.032 --> 00:05:04.240
vu KAPEL'MASTER," zog ikh, "in ⟨k-⟩ OKOP?"

00:05:05.517 --> 00:05:10.430
"a," zogt er, "CH-, CH- CHЁRNO-ZH...."

00:05:10.461 --> 00:05:12.412
flegn zey zogn. dos heyst

00:05:12.975 --> 00:05:17.600
a shvartser hintn, flegn zey onrufn di, di NATSMENes.

00:05:18.713 --> 00:05:20.647
"fun dir vet men gornisht nit nemen.

00:05:23.117 --> 00:05:25.473
UVEDI EGO!" hot men mir opgefirt.

00:05:26.661 --> 00:05:29.540
a tsveytn mol hot men mir oykhet aroysgerufn in dem lager,

00:05:29.766 --> 00:05:35.379
shoyn in komendature... dos iz geven nit in komendature. dos iz geven in an ander ort avu iz geven di POLIZEIen...

00:05:35.875 --> 00:05:40.748
iz gezesn a NEMETS iz gezesn lebn tish, un ikh, bay mir rayst zikh op di harts.

00:05:40.748 --> 00:05:44.356
mir dukht az imetser hot shoyn mir D- gemasert;

00:05:45.257 --> 00:05:47.160
dos gey ikh oyfn toyt.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:50.364
es firt mir der vakh-man in komendature.

00:05:50.455 --> 00:05:52.524
es zitst a NEMETS lebn tish.

00:05:53.526 --> 00:05:56.557
zogt er, "TY," zogt er, "ZHIL V BAKU?"

00:05:57.593 --> 00:06:01.200
tsu mir. geredt oyf rusish, a NEMETS.

00:06:01.845 --> 00:06:05.200
zog ikh, "DA. YA ZHIL V BAKU."

00:06:05.811 --> 00:06:08.387
er redt mit a NEMETSKn aktsent.

00:06:08.848 --> 00:06:14.731
zogt er, "SKAZHI, KAKIE TAM, EST', PREDPRIYATIYA?"

00:06:15.042 --> 00:06:19.660
"velkhe iz faran dortn, INDUSTRIYA?" UNK

00:06:19.682 --> 00:06:23.360
zog ikh, "NEFT' DOBYVAYUT."

00:06:24.019 --> 00:06:26.443
ONI, zey hobn zikh geyogt

00:06:26.702 --> 00:06:29.176
farkhapn Azerbaydzhan, Baku.

00:06:29.436 --> 00:06:30.898
dortn iz NEFT'.

00:06:31.005 --> 00:06:33.361
zey hobn geyogt zikh ahin, di NEMTSes.

00:06:34.161 --> 00:06:37.566
bay zey iz NEFT' nit geven. zey hobn gedarft hobn NEFT'. veyst vos s'iz NEFT'?

00:06:37.566 --> 00:06:38.846
me makht benzin,

00:06:39.004 --> 00:06:41.507
oyf di tanken zoln forn, di SAMO-

00:06:41.507 --> 00:06:43.160
di ETO zoln forn.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.330
farshteyst? zog ikh,

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.923
"TAM EST'," zog ikh... zogt er, "ESHCHЁ KAKIE ZAVODY?"

00:06:48.923 --> 00:06:50.330
"velkhe nokh?"

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:53.257
zog ikh, "broyt makht men,

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.839
konfetn makht men," zog ikh.

00:06:56.453 --> 00:06:57.797
zogt er,

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:03.855
"⟨militazhir,⟩ m- m- militer!" zogt er. "vos redstu? DUMMKOPF!"

00:07:04.114 --> 00:07:08.073
zog ikh, "me makht patrones oyf shisn fun ⟨dos o⟩.

00:07:08.299 --> 00:07:10.537
es iz faran," zog ikh, "a aerodrom,

00:07:10.712 --> 00:07:13.642
a, vu di flier zetsn zikh arop."

00:07:14.492 --> 00:07:17.210
git er a zog dem vakh-man... nokh dortn epes a...

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:19.112
"me makht konservn," zog ikh.

00:07:19.112 --> 00:07:20.910
"konservn," zog ikh, "makht men

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:24.661
in pushkelekh, fun, fun, fish."

00:07:25.714 --> 00:07:29.893
dortn iz KASPIY, KASPIY, a yam, KASPIYSKe yam.

00:07:30.372 --> 00:07:31.921
khapt men dortn fish.

00:07:31.921 --> 00:07:33.892
zog ikh, "fish khapt men."

00:07:34.118 --> 00:07:36.120
zogt er, "DUMMKOPF!"

00:07:36.683 --> 00:07:38.719
dos heyst DURNAYA GOLOVA.

00:07:39.484 --> 00:07:41.503
un geheysn mir opfirn kerik.

00:07:41.509 --> 00:07:45.560
ikh bin gekumen. bay mir di harts geyt opet. farshteyst?

00:07:46.487 --> 00:07:52.510
eyn mol, ergets in lager, s'iz geven ergets in SOLINGEN. dos UNK...

00:07:53.254 --> 00:07:57.270
hot men undz otpravet, m'hot undz geshikt,

00:07:57.726 --> 00:07:59.323
oyfn stantsye

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.090
nokh a bombardirung

00:08:02.147 --> 00:08:03.739
fun di Amerikaner

00:08:03.739 --> 00:08:05.888
un englishe luft-flier.

00:08:05.944 --> 00:08:08.722
es iz geflien KREPOSTI, hot men zey gerufn.

00:08:08.813 --> 00:08:11.287
es iz geven fir motorn, fir,

00:08:11.563 --> 00:08:15.240
fir motorn UNK mit di propelern, fir azelkhe.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.884
flit der SAMOLЁT,

00:08:16.884 --> 00:08:19.083
iz varft er bombes a velt.

00:08:19.275 --> 00:08:22.475
iz oyf di stantsyes iber hoypt, oder oyf di UNK...

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:26.762
iz undz hot men ge- flegt men traybn ahin o

00:08:27.156 --> 00:08:30.744
fargrobn di griber, tife griber, vi hayzer di greys,

00:08:30.852 --> 00:08:36.430
 fanandernemen di vagones di tsebrokhene.,

00:08:37.972 --> 00:08:40.796
iz in der arbet, beys mir zaynen geven,

00:08:40.796 --> 00:08:44.683
her vos es treft. bay hayntikn tog trakht ikh vegn der zakh,

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:49.188
iz farshtey ikh nit, ikh hob geton rikhtik tsi ikh hob geton nit rikhtik,

00:08:49.465 --> 00:08:51.686
un tsum sof kum ikh tsu geyn

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:54.453
az efsher hob ikh geton rikhtik.

00:08:55.658 --> 00:08:59.050
YA VOT... es shteyt mir in di oygn, ot azoy vi

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:00.968
du kukst oyf mir, ot dem

00:09:01.429 --> 00:09:03.349
slutshay, oto dem moment.

00:09:03.349 --> 00:09:04.581
ot dos o

00:09:04.581 --> 00:09:07.470
fargedenk ikh di gantse tsayt, un es shteyt mir

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.480
in di oygn oto der

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.278
moment, vos kh'hob ge- oyfgeton.

00:09:11.807 --> 00:09:14.096
un ikh veys nit tsi ikh hob gedarft zikh,

00:09:14.507 --> 00:09:16.846
kh'hob dos getort ton tsi nit getort ton.

00:09:17.764 --> 00:09:21.280
mir hobn derhert, es fort a pasazhir,

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.230
avu es forn mentshn, a ban,

00:09:24.345 --> 00:09:25.857
fort zeyer gikh.

00:09:26.505 --> 00:09:31.260
er flit azoy gikh az es, di relsn, vi es geyen, klapt er zikh ot azoy,

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:34.009
di reder iber di relsn, azoy flit er.

00:09:34.521 --> 00:09:37.770
fun der vaytn a kilometer tsvey

00:09:37.963 --> 00:09:41.200
iz geven a tunel.

00:09:41.524 --> 00:09:43.509
a tunel, dos iz a barg

00:09:43.988 --> 00:09:47.509
durkh velkher iz gemakht gevorn a durkhgang

00:09:47.667 --> 00:09:54.750
vu es fort durkh der poyezd, der, der ban fort durkh, a pasazhir,

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.696
s'iz gezesn, geven pasazhirn. dos heyst, pasazhir, ⟨dos iz⟩ mentshisher.

00:09:59.293 --> 00:10:00.716
er hot nit gefirt keyn,

00:10:00.716 --> 00:10:04.960
, keyn, GRUZOVOY,

00:10:05.233 --> 00:10:06.847
nor a mentshisher ban.

00:10:07.377 --> 00:10:10.813
iz beys ⟨s'iz⟩ durkh undz geflien der, poyezd,

00:10:10.903 --> 00:10:12.959
der ban, hobn mir gezen

00:10:12.959 --> 00:10:15.976
a loyfenish fun di NEMTSes. es iz geflien

00:10:16.405 --> 00:10:21.191
a S- a, a ISTREBOK, a SAMOLЁT, a flier,

00:10:21.467 --> 00:10:23.151
a gringer flier,

00:10:23.151 --> 00:10:26.240
a FRANTSUZSKer... mir hobn shoyn gevust velkhe flier flien...

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:30.202
a FRANTSUZSKer, un hot geSTROCHet in dem poyezd geshosn.

00:10:30.377 --> 00:10:33.476
er flit un shist in dem poyezd. nu, mir zaynen tsufridn.

00:10:33.533 --> 00:10:35.737
mir gefangene zaynen tsufridn.

00:10:35.862 --> 00:10:38.290
farshteyst? "a!

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:41.600
es gefelt nit!" makht tsu mir, shteyt a GRUZIN,

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:45.722
makht er, "NE NRAVITSYA!" "es gefelt nit!" zogt er.

00:10:45.722 --> 00:10:49.230
az undzere hobn zey geharget un geshosn,

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:53.430
 glat in der velt arayn, makht nit oys. ze vi es gefelt nit!

00:10:53.430 --> 00:10:56.412
me flit arum in poyezd un do in di TAMBURes, tsvishn

00:10:56.412 --> 00:10:58.822
eyn vagon un tsveytn: ot a vagon

00:10:58.845 --> 00:11:01.589
un ot a vagon, iz do faran a PROKHOD.

00:11:02.001 --> 00:11:07.070
 iz dortn eyne a ZHENSHCHINe, a vaybl gehaltn a kind.

00:11:08.835 --> 00:11:13.537
genumen, di kind... ikh hob ⟨d-⟩ ikh hob nit bamerkt, nor ikh hob bamerkt vi s'iz aroysgefloygn.

00:11:13.864 --> 00:11:15.962
zi hot zikh aleyn fun shrek

00:11:15.962 --> 00:11:17.976
hot zi aroysgevorfn di kind.

00:11:19.585 --> 00:11:21.992
es iz geven fardreyt in onitses, a kind.

00:11:22.875 --> 00:11:27.410
un ikh bin geshtanen in zayt mit a lom. veyst vos s'iz a lom? an ayzener,

00:11:27.516 --> 00:11:28.761
vos heybt dos.

00:11:28.761 --> 00:11:30.289
un do iz geshtanen,

00:11:30.289 --> 00:11:33.923
 d- der GRUZIN... ⟨vi hot⟩, vi hot er geheysn?

00:11:34.182 --> 00:11:38.010
 nu, ikh hob zikh fargesn vi er hot zikh gerufn...

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.400
iz er geshtanen mit a lopete.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.590
 GАRO- ETO SARKISYAN iz geshtanen.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:49.312
itster, s'iz ge-, geven... nit SARKISYAN — der, BUBUSHYAN VERNEE.

00:11:49.437 --> 00:11:51.641
VOT. MELKONYAN vayter a bisl.

00:11:51.715 --> 00:11:54.696
un ikh bin azoy avekgegangen nokh der kind.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.593
hot aroysgevorfn di kind.

00:11:59.359 --> 00:12:02.475
ikh bin avek nokh der kind. a NEMKe hot aroysgevorfn di kind.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.917
ikh bin avek nokh der NEMETSKer kind.

00:12:08.252 --> 00:12:09.528
du farshteyst?

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:15.148
keseyder trakht ikh, "v- tsulib vos hot, hob ikh dos geton? ikh hob ⟨dokh⟩ geton rikhtik, tsi nit?"

00:12:15.205 --> 00:12:18.557
nor instinktiv bin ikh avek, instinktiv.

00:12:18.867 --> 00:12:20.464
ikh bin avekgegangen,

00:12:21.313 --> 00:12:24.192
un az ikh bin dergangen tsu dem ort, tsu der kind...

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.602
efsher a khadoshim akht a kind.

00:12:28.603 --> 00:12:35.532
zi iz oyf, oyf a, oyf a santimeter finf iz zi nit geven aroyfgevorfn oyfn, oyfn rels oyf der ayzener.

00:12:38.661 --> 00:12:41.034
ir hot, zi iz geven a farblutikte,

00:12:41.293 --> 00:12:45.315
nor zi iz geven ayngedreyt in onitses; s'iz geven kalt, iz zi geven ayngedreyt

00:12:45.315 --> 00:12:47.498
in onitses, in fatsheyles,

00:12:48.297 --> 00:12:52.730
iz hot zi nokh gelebt, mitn kop arop, un zi iz geven a, zi hot

00:12:52.819 --> 00:12:54.922
nit gekent di-, d- dishen.

00:12:55.553 --> 00:12:57.099
ikh hob ir oyfgehoybn.

00:12:57.662 --> 00:13:01.270
ikh hob ir umgekert azoy a farblutikte, un ikh trog ir

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:04.340
oyf oysgetsite hent, zey zoln

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:07.241
nit, meynen az ikh shtik ir,

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.469
di tsvey vakh-manes.

00:13:10.234 --> 00:13:15.105
es iz ongegangen, ongelo- -gegangen a, a, a vaybl a NEMKe

00:13:15.516 --> 00:13:18.850
in, ZHELEZNODOROZHNe,

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.935
in ⟨F-⟩ in ban, begodim.

00:13:23.751 --> 00:13:26.895
farshteyst? in grine, in azelkhe,

00:13:26.895 --> 00:13:29.820
 SIN⟨e⟩. vi heyst dos, in,...?

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:35.169
nu, zol zayn grine. ikh veys UNK ikh veys nit vi firt men iber SIN⟨e⟩.

00:13:35.226 --> 00:13:39.240
ot. hot zi dos ge- get-, tsugenumen bay mir

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.160
un gezogt mir, "DANKE SCHÖN."

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:46.357
 "a dank."

00:13:46.988 --> 00:13:48.570
zi hot mir gezogt.

00:13:49.435 --> 00:13:50.947
un ikh gey tsu

00:13:51.477 --> 00:13:52.989
un ikh nem dem lom.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.174
makht tsu mir, untergegangen MELKONYAN,

00:13:58.412 --> 00:13:59.891
zogt er tsu mir,

00:14:03.002 --> 00:14:08.632
"vest bald POLUCHen," zogt er, "⟨an o⟩rdn fun di doytshn.

00:14:09.769 --> 00:14:11.400
tsulib vos ⟨hostu⟩ dos geton?"

00:14:11.963 --> 00:14:13.442
er zogt dos tsu mir.

00:14:14.865 --> 00:14:16.310
zog ikh, "s'iz a kind.

00:14:16.992 --> 00:14:19.180
ikh hob..." zog ikh, "antshuldik mir...

00:14:20.063 --> 00:14:25.692
instinktiv." zogt er, "host nit gezen in Horlovke vos hobn zey geton mit kinder,

00:14:26.644 --> 00:14:28.545
un mit mames un mit tates?

00:14:31.369 --> 00:14:34.940
der vakh-man," zogt er, "der geler, hot dir shir nit geshosn.

00:14:35.436 --> 00:14:38.687
er hot shoyn genumen," zogt er, "oyf dir ongeshtelt," zogt er, "di biks.

00:14:38.727 --> 00:14:40.318
hot der tsveyter," zogt er,

00:14:40.318 --> 00:14:42.230
"im aropgeklapt di hant."

00:14:45.426 --> 00:14:46.534
du farshteyst?

00:14:46.675 --> 00:14:48.670
ikh hob gevorn royt.

00:14:51.687 --> 00:14:54.111
dernokh dem hob ikh ongehoybn trakhtn.

00:14:54.454 --> 00:14:57.468
ikh hob ongehoybn trakhtn, "alemay hob ikh dos geton?"

00:15:00.664 --> 00:15:03.425
mir hot der oykhet gegebn an oysreyd, der GRUZIN.

00:15:05.288 --> 00:15:08.623
ikh hob dos geton instinktiv; dos iz bay mir in mayne genes.

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:10.176
s'iz bay mir ineveynik.

00:15:10.468 --> 00:15:14.827
du farshteyst tsi nit? kentik ineveynik az a kind

00:15:14.827 --> 00:15:17.449
darf men rateven. me darf der kind,

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:20.016
zen az di kind,

00:15:20.016 --> 00:15:23.500
SPASAen ir. oyf, oyf rusish heyst SPASAen. dos heyst, me darf ir

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.088
helfn, a kind a kleyne, nit shuldik.

00:15:26.888 --> 00:15:28.721
ineveynik in di genes.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:32.800
dos hot dokh gedarft zayn an optsol far mayne k-

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:37.250
far mayn briderl Yankelen, vos m'hot im geharget.

00:15:39.831 --> 00:15:41.770
un ikh hob dos geratevet.

00:15:42.143 --> 00:15:44.418
dos ⟨volt⟩ farkhlinyet vern

00:15:44.418 --> 00:15:46.423
mit di blut mit ire, mit alts.

00:15:50.732 --> 00:15:53.240
dos keseyder geyt mir arayn in kop.

00:15:56.368 --> 00:15:57.914
in a tsveytn lager

00:15:58.545 --> 00:15:59.821
hot men undz

00:16:00.537 --> 00:16:02.353
gerufn, mir zoln arayngeyn

00:16:02.612 --> 00:16:05.306
tsum komendant ale ARMYANes.

00:16:06.662 --> 00:16:07.820
mir zaynen ts⟨u-⟩...

00:16:06.747 --> 00:16:09.090
dos iz an andere lager yetst?

00:16:07.877 --> 00:16:11.077
mir zaynen gekumen in an ander lager; s'iz ergets geven in MÜNSINGEN.

00:16:11.387 --> 00:16:15.144
m'hot undz gebrakht tsu traybn ahin o... vart, dernokh dem vestu bashraybn di lagern...

00:16:15.471 --> 00:16:19.852
m'hot gebrakht tsu tribn... dos gib ikh dir eynike momentn velkhe s'iz geven, nit ale...

00:16:20.348 --> 00:16:26.991
m'hot, iz, fun der arbet zaynen mir gekumen. mir hobn shoyn gevolt loyfn nemen BALANDA; s'iz shoyn fintster, vinter.

00:16:27.604 --> 00:16:29.926
mir zaynen gekumen fun vald, oyf vald-arbet.

00:16:31.519 --> 00:16:38.313
tsum, arayngeyn nor di ARMYANes, zoln kumen tsum, tsum lager. hob ikh farshtanen az dos ⟨hot⟩ imetser mir gemasert.

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:40.490
mir zaynen gekumen.

00:16:40.902 --> 00:16:42.881
mir shteyen ale ARMYANes.

00:16:42.881 --> 00:16:45.570
ARMYANes zaynen geven a man draysik.

00:16:46.403 --> 00:16:52.736
ale hobn gehert dem o, MELKONYANen. MELKONYAN iz geven der onfirer fun zey, fun ale ARMYAN⟨im⟩, nor mir hot er holt gehat azoy vi a,

00:16:52.736 --> 00:16:53.939
azoy vi a zun.

00:16:56.359 --> 00:17:00.707
im iz geven a yor tsvantsik zibn; mir iz geven tsvey un tsvantsik. er zogt,

00:17:00.831 --> 00:17:05.291
"TY," zogt er, "ZHENISH'SYA," makht er, "NA MOYU SESTRЁNKU. EY SHESTNADTSAT' LET."

00:17:05.291 --> 00:17:07.895
"du vest khasene hobn," zogt er, "oyf mayn shvester,

00:17:08.172 --> 00:17:11.136
oyf mayn shvesterl. ir iz," zogt er, "shoyn zekhtsn yor."

00:17:12.053 --> 00:17:14.090
er. er hot mir gehaltn,

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.856
er hot mir azoy holt gehat ⟨K-⟩ KAK BRATA.

00:17:18.718 --> 00:17:23.521
vayle vos iz? ikh fleg keyn mol mit key- mit keynem nit, krign zikh.

00:17:23.967 --> 00:17:25.631
ikh fleg alts hern.

00:17:26.278 --> 00:17:30.761
ikh fleg, vintsik arayntretn in, reyd.

00:17:31.003 --> 00:17:32.448
ikh fleg nor hern.

00:17:32.573 --> 00:17:36.550
ikh fleg zogn lekhatkhile, fleg, ikh hob dokh nit gekent oyf

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:39.370
ARMYANSKI lekhatkhile gornit. dernokh dem hob ikh shoyn

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.186
gikh, farshtanen di verter, fleg ikh shoyn visn.

00:17:42.529 --> 00:17:46.590
flegt er, flegt er z- flegt men tsu mir reydn, "MISHKA," flegn zey zogn,

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:51.348
"POCHEMU TY GOVORISH' "NET" KOGDA NADO GOVORIT' "DA,"

00:17:52.215 --> 00:17:54.718
ILI KOGDA NADO GOVORIT' "DA," GOVORISH' "NET?""

00:17:54.718 --> 00:17:57.975
dos heyst, "far vos zogstu "nit" az me darf zogn "ye,"

00:17:57.975 --> 00:18:00.242
oder me darf zogn "ye," zogstu "nit?""

00:18:01.041 --> 00:18:04.629
fleg ikh glaykh oysdreyen zikh, zukhn a, a vort.

00:18:05.023 --> 00:18:12.071
nit ale ARMYAN⟨en h⟩obn dokh gevust az ikh ken nit reydn oyf, oyf, oyf ARMYANSKe.

00:18:12.955 --> 00:18:14.032
zog ikh,

00:18:14.032 --> 00:18:18.120
"YA SKAZAL ⟨D-⟩..." fleg ikh oysdreyen zikh, fleg ikh darfn zukhn a mitl.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:21.422
dernokh dem hob ikh shoyn ongehoybn farshteyn vos zey reydn,

00:18:21.422 --> 00:18:24.280
iz in a fraze

00:18:24.852 --> 00:18:26.618
fun tsen verter

00:18:26.843 --> 00:18:31.056
fleg ikh trefn do dray, fir verter, fleg ikh shoyn visn vegn vos me redt.

00:18:31.483 --> 00:18:35.206
farshteyst? fleg ikh shoyn VPOPAD, fleg ikh shoyn ETO SAM.

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:37.738
iz vos iz? geyt aroys der ershter.

00:18:38.318 --> 00:18:41.839
zogt er, "ZA STOLOM zitst, SIDIT KOMENDANT LAGERYA.

00:18:43.144 --> 00:18:45.917
U NEGO," zogt er, "UZHE STEKLYANNYY GLAZ NET.

00:18:45.917 --> 00:18:48.650
U NEGO," zogt er, "KAK U ETOGO.",

00:18:49.084 --> 00:18:51.896
kurts geredt... un es zitsn tsvey ARMYANes,

00:18:52.341 --> 00:18:54.225
BYVSHIE BELOGVARDEYTSY,

00:18:54.501 --> 00:18:58.548
vos zaynen fun der elt- ershter velt-milkhome antlofn gevorn fun di Royte

00:18:58.548 --> 00:19:01.481
I ZHIVUT V GERM- un ⟨ge⟩lebt in GERMANye, zaynen VLASOVTSes,

00:19:01.977 --> 00:19:04.958
un me ruft in der VLASOVSKer armye.

00:19:05.082 --> 00:19:08.757
un oyfn tish shteyt alerleyike esekhts. mir zaynen hungerike.

00:19:08.757 --> 00:19:11.237
shteyt dortn o gezharete hiner,

00:19:11.237 --> 00:19:13.270
fleysh g- gebrote,

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.550
es shteyt branfn, es shteyt broyt, emese broyt.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:20.347
geyen zey aroys, un es ⟨lekt⟩ di ⟨shlunges⟩.

00:19:21.366 --> 00:19:23.351
un zey reydn nor oyf armenish.

00:19:24.252 --> 00:19:26.540
farshtey ikh az do iz mayn sof.

00:19:27.897 --> 00:19:29.156
vos tut men?

00:19:29.517 --> 00:19:30.894
vos tut men?!

00:19:30.968 --> 00:19:33.324
do rukt zikh unter GАROYAN, zogt er...

00:19:34.157 --> 00:19:35.959
farshteyst, es ken

00:19:35.959 --> 00:19:37.947
imetser fun di ARMYANer

00:19:38.022 --> 00:19:40.940
a zog ton dem komendant oyf,

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:43.890
az er zol oyf mir, mir PROVERen.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.460
vi iz dos, an ARMYANIN zol nit kenen ARMYANSKe?

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.086
yeder ARMYANIN redt ARMYAN- armenish.

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:52.106
yeder TSYGAN redt oyf TSYGANSKe.

00:19:52.365 --> 00:19:53.594
nor a yid,

00:19:53.594 --> 00:19:57.928
nit ale yidn redn yidish. ot dos iz dokh interesant. far vos?

00:19:58.913 --> 00:19:59.936
farshteyst?

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:04.560
geyt unter tsu mir MELKONYAN un zogt, "CHTO TY MECHESH'SYA?

00:20:04.701 --> 00:20:07.120
CHTO TY," zogt er, "GRUSTNYY ⟨S-⟩ TAKOY STOISH'?"

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.470
"vos," zogt er, "bistu tsetrogn?

00:20:09.578 --> 00:20:11.428
vos shteystu aza umetiker?"

00:20:11.856 --> 00:20:13.115
zog ikh, "MELKONYAN,

00:20:14.269 --> 00:20:15.360
TY ZNAESH' CHTO?

00:20:16.716 --> 00:20:18.448
ONI ZOVUT NAS V ARMIYU.

00:20:19.011 --> 00:20:21.500
VOT SKAZAL," zog ikh, "AKOP.

00:20:22.335 --> 00:20:24.340
DAVAY MY IM SDELAEM BOYKOT."

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.087
"zey rufn undz in armye.

00:20:26.087 --> 00:20:27.746
kum, mir'n zey boykotirn.

00:20:28.107 --> 00:20:33.433
kum, mir'n alemen zogn, zog alemen, az mir kenen nit reydn oyf

00:20:34.249 --> 00:20:37.230
ARMYANSKe; mir reydn nor oyf rusish.

00:20:37.658 --> 00:20:40.115
a boykot gebn ale, ale zoln zogn."

00:20:42.805 --> 00:20:44.149
zey hern zikh im.

00:20:46.855 --> 00:20:49.190
s'iz shoyn dergangen mayn rey.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.978
shoyn aroys MELKONYAN,

00:20:52.238 --> 00:20:54.088
zogt er, "IDI, POKUSHAY TAM!"

00:20:56.322 --> 00:21:00.366
NIKTO NE, keyne- "IDI, gey es dortn op!" zogt er.

00:21:01.249 --> 00:21:02.643
er hot gekhoyzekt.

00:21:03.021 --> 00:21:06.470
keyner hot ni- ale hobn zikh antzagt. ver vil dos geyn?

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:08.617
es geyt shoyn tsum sof tsu der milkhome.

00:21:08.657 --> 00:21:11.654
ver vil dos geyn in zeyer armey

00:21:11.998 --> 00:21:13.494
fun di farreter?

00:21:15.694 --> 00:21:19.771
UNK dertseyln dir ver iz di VLASOVTSes, ⟨fun vemen zey⟩ zaynen gemakht gevorn?

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:24.160
zey zaynen gemakht fun UGOLOVNIKes, zaynen gemakht gevorn fun di turmes aroysgelozn,

00:21:24.160 --> 00:21:26.020
fun POLIZEIen vos hobn geharget

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:29.104
yidn, zey hobn geharget eygene partizaner.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:32.692
ot dos iz di VLASOVTSes.

00:21:32.692 --> 00:21:36.185
itster o loybt men di VLASOVTSes. faran do in Amerike,

00:21:36.185 --> 00:21:38.132
eynike loybn di VLASOVTSes,

00:21:38.239 --> 00:21:40.560
halemay hot Stalin eynike geharget.

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:44.050
zey zaynen geven gevert, vert geven, me zol tsehargenen.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:46.260
me flegt nemen in VLASOVTSes lekhatkhile

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:49.741
di velkhe flegn farretn, a yid,

00:21:50.052 --> 00:21:52.420
a komisar, farreter

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.501
velkhe flegn partizaner aroysgebn.

00:21:55.030 --> 00:21:57.300
me fleg farnemen, tsum bayshpil,

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:00.150
me, me greykht onet undzer armey,

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:03.240
di NEMTSes geyen opet; vos tuen oto di POLIZEIen?

00:22:03.240 --> 00:22:05.047
me shikt zey in di VLASOVTSes.

00:22:05.239 --> 00:22:08.310
VLASOV aleyn iz geven a groyser farreter. er iz geven a mol

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.734
nokh fun di Vayse, fun di POLIZEIen...

00:22:11.888 --> 00:22:15.291
UNK fun di, BELOGVARDEYTSes.

00:22:16.242 --> 00:22:18.818
ver zogt az zayn mame iz geven a NEMKe?

00:22:19.684 --> 00:22:23.064
kurts geredt, ikh gey itst shoyn arayn ahin o.

00:22:23.064 --> 00:22:25.980
a tish, es shmekt alts.

00:22:26.316 --> 00:22:29.600
vos du vilst iz dortn avekgeshtelt gevorn: epl, ⟨UNK⟩epl,

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:33.822
alts gezharete, yeder zakh geparete, yeder zakh gebrote,

00:22:33.822 --> 00:22:37.180
 es zol undz...

00:22:37.453 --> 00:22:40.501
zogt er tsu mir... oyf ARMYANSKe redt er tsu mir.

00:22:42.735 --> 00:22:45.108
ikh hob oyfgekhapt vos er redt mir.

00:22:46.077 --> 00:22:47.826
er zogt, "zets zikh avek

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:49.934
un es dos altsenesding."

00:22:51.325 --> 00:22:53.428
zog ikh tsu im oyf rusish,

00:22:55.206 --> 00:22:57.157
"CHTO VY MNE GOVORILI?

00:22:57.433 --> 00:22:59.680
CHTO TY, CHTO TY MNE GOVORI-

00:22:59.680 --> 00:23:01.916
CHTO..." "vos hostu mir gezogt?"

00:23:03.998 --> 00:23:05.325
zogt er,

00:23:05.483 --> 00:23:08.835
"YA TEBE SKAZA- ikh hob dir gezogt, zolst zikh zetsn esn."

00:23:09.853 --> 00:23:11.180
zog ikh, "neyn.

00:23:11.457 --> 00:23:13.476
oyb ikh zets zikh dos esn"...

00:23:14.494 --> 00:23:15.832
oyf rusish zog ikh im...

00:23:15.832 --> 00:23:17.626
"oyb ikh zets zikh dos esn,

00:23:17.987 --> 00:23:21.103
vet zikh bay mir fananderdreyen ale mayne kishkes,

00:23:21.548 --> 00:23:23.280
iz demolt mir a sof.

00:23:23.623 --> 00:23:25.979
ikh bin dokh," zog ikh, "a hungeriker. ikh hob dokh

00:23:26.003 --> 00:23:28.393
keyn mol nit gegesn keyn fets

00:23:30.728 --> 00:23:32.730
shoyn," zog ikh, "ot bald dray yor."

00:23:34.508 --> 00:23:37.286
zogt er, "dray yor bistu do?

00:23:37.731 --> 00:23:39.446
vifl bistu alt?"

00:23:41.663 --> 00:23:42.973
zogt er,

00:23:43.873 --> 00:23:46.750
"kum," zogt er, "tsu undz;

00:23:47.957 --> 00:23:49.875
du vest zayn," zogt er,

00:23:51.248 --> 00:23:53.284
"mir'n dir nit shikn oyfn

00:23:53.931 --> 00:23:56.332
front, oyfn, geshleg.

00:23:56.332 --> 00:23:57.755
du vest zayn a hiter.

00:23:59.061 --> 00:24:02.632
du vest in a lager hitn," zogt er, "gefangene."

00:24:03.094 --> 00:24:04.421
er zogt tsu mir.

00:24:06.553 --> 00:24:08.774
zog ikh, "ikh gey ergets nit.

00:24:08.832 --> 00:24:10.997
ikh bin oyfn front geven," zog ikh,

00:24:10.997 --> 00:24:14.060
"tsvey vokhn tsayt, mer gor.

00:24:14.299 --> 00:24:17.814
ikh bin shoyn," zog ikh, "a kranker. ikh vil nit geyn,"

00:24:17.814 --> 00:24:19.676
zog ikh, "oyfn front."

00:24:21.657 --> 00:24:23.237
zogt er tsu mir,

00:24:24.795 --> 00:24:26.341
"bistu," zogt er,

00:24:27.715 --> 00:24:30.071
"vi bistu," zogt er, "arayn in soldatn?"

00:24:31.461 --> 00:24:32.841
git er iber dem,

00:24:32.841 --> 00:24:34.799
 dem komendant,

00:24:34.799 --> 00:24:37.091
zogt er, "er iz DUMMKOPF."

00:24:37.485 --> 00:24:39.149
"U NEGO DURNAYA GOLOVA.

00:24:39.831 --> 00:24:44.010
⟨I,"⟩ zogt er, "⟨K-⟩ v- vi Stalin hot dos genumen

00:24:44.505 --> 00:24:47.300
azelkhe mentshn in armey... er iz dokh a kind!"

00:24:48.201 --> 00:24:50.962
dem, komendant, UNK ⟨a⟩ hoykher.

00:24:51.103 --> 00:24:55.535
bay im iz, geven a glezene oyg,

00:24:56.503 --> 00:24:59.006
mit a T- mit a groyse TSARAPINA aher.

00:24:59.006 --> 00:25:00.969
dos hot men im UNK oyfn front oysgeklapt.

00:25:01.347 --> 00:25:07.089
iz, bay im keseyder arayngeshtelt an oyg, un do iz bay im geven KAK RAZ, itster gedenk ikh,

00:25:07.089 --> 00:25:11.612
iz bay im geven aza min o, f-, fun,

00:25:11.612 --> 00:25:13.440
 fun leder,

00:25:13.699 --> 00:25:18.249
vos me fardreyt oto do o I oto... iz er gezesn azoy vi a pirat. veyst vos s'iz pirat?

00:25:18.373 --> 00:25:19.767
faran oyf shifn,

00:25:19.926 --> 00:25:23.520
flegn forn, piratn, iz faran aza min,

00:25:23.520 --> 00:25:26.031
 mayse, a pirat mit an oyg mit eyn fus.

00:25:26.031 --> 00:25:28.644
aza hot er gehat glants.

00:25:28.650 --> 00:25:30.602
, kurts geredt,

00:25:31.131 --> 00:25:34.500
zogt er, "WEG!" "aroys!"

00:25:35.164 --> 00:25:39.731
nor ikh de- ⟨v-⟩ tsulib vos hob ikh dertseylt? dakht zikh, s'iz a poshete zakh,

00:25:39.957 --> 00:25:43.444
nor in yeder posheter zakh iz gelegn mayn toyt.

00:25:44.378 --> 00:25:47.260
ot do iz gekumen mir in kop

00:25:47.382 --> 00:25:49.232
o- der oystrakht,

00:25:49.423 --> 00:25:51.990
vos durkh MELKONYANen

00:25:51.990 --> 00:25:55.441
hob ikh gekent virkn oyf ale ARMYANer.

00:25:57.237 --> 00:25:58.322
farshteyst?

00:25:58.322 --> 00:26:01.830
un zey hobn ale geredt az zey kenen nit reydn...

00:26:02.755 --> 00:26:04.650
khuts di ershte etlekhe...

00:26:04.650 --> 00:26:06.714
az zey kenen nit reydn

00:26:06.923 --> 00:26:10.224
oyf armenish — nor oyf rusish. mir hot er gezogt,

00:26:10.483 --> 00:26:15.995
"TY," zogt er, "NE MOZHESH' GOVORIT'," zogt er, "PO-R- PO-RUSSKI."

00:26:16.018 --> 00:26:19.049
ikh hob dokh geredt mit a, a groysn aktsent spetsyel.

00:26:19.174 --> 00:26:21.665
"du kenst nit reydn oyf rusish.

00:26:22.212 --> 00:26:24.672
es tsit bay dir," zogt er, "ARMYANish.

00:26:24.672 --> 00:26:26.728
WEG," zogt er, "DUMMKOPF!"

00:26:27.072 --> 00:26:28.980
mir azoy aroysgetribn.
